== Old-map engravings (art/*.webp) ==
All pieces were processed the same way: cropped to one subject, paper flattened and made transparent,
ink recoloured to a single sepia (#3a2414) with alpha taken from ink darkness, specks/stains removed,
resized, saved as WebP. Plate numbers and plate border lines were removed where noted.

